# Release/deployment control-plane inputs are deliberately outside the image.
# Keeping deploy/product-manifest.json out of COPY . . breaks the impossible
# image-digest -> product-manifest -> image-digest self-reference. CI binds the
# two immutable facts with image-release.json after the registry returns the
# pushed image digest.
